			"notes": "- Changed Style Packs to use Data Packs file structure (Old Packs will auto-convert).\n- Updated Server/Client Syncing\n\t- Clients will now only display Styles registered to the Server-side.\n\t- If Models are missing on the Client-side, a fallback \"Missing Style\" is used instead.\n- Added Texture Variants\n- Added Credits\n- Added Armor and Curios/Trinkets options for \"hidden_parts\". \n\t- armor.\\*, armor.head, armor.chest, armor.legs, armor.feet \n\t- curios.\\*, curios.head.*, curios.head.hat, etc.\n- Updated Wardrobe UI. \n\t- Now respects GUI Scale and displays more styles on bigger resolutions and/or smaller GUI Scales\n\t- Added Search Bar\n- Removed Armor Visiblity Toggle from Wardrobe UI\n- Fixed Animations with multiple players"
		},
