			"notes": "**Stylepacks Update**\n\n- Added Style Packs. Any Resource Pack, containing a styles.json file, can be put into the Styles folder to have those styles automatically registered, and assets automatically loaded. This feature makes sharing styles significantly easier for end-users!\n- Misc changes and fixes, including a performance fix when rendering multiple Styles.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/BounceSMP/BounceStyles/compare/2.2.0...2.4.0"
		},
